[{"id":"fm-core1-1.48-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Show that</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac13k(k+1)(k+2)+(k+1)(k+2)=\\frac13(k+1)(k+2)(k+3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{k}{k+1}+\\frac1{(k+1)(k+2)}=\\frac{k+1}{k+2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(k+1)!-1+(k+1)(k+1)!=(k+2)!-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac13k(k+1)(k+2)+(k+1)(k+2)=(k+1)(k+2)\\left(\\frac13k+1\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac13(k+1)(k+2)(k+3).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{k}{k+1}+\\frac1{(k+1)(k+2)}=\\frac{k(k+2)}{(k+1)(k+2)}+\\frac1{(k+1)(k+2)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{k(k+2)+1}{(k+1)(k+2)}=\\frac{k^2+2k+1}{(k+1)(k+2)}=\\frac{(k+1)^2}{(k+1)(k+2)}=\\frac{k+1}{k+2}\\text{ as req.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(k+1)!-1+(k+1)(k+1)!=(k+1)![1+(k+1)]-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=(k+1)!(k+2)-1=(k+2)!-1\\text{ as req.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.48-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n2^{r-1}=2^n-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n4^r=\\frac43(4^n-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1 2^{r-1}=2^{1-1}=1,\\qquad 2^1-1=1,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^k2^{r-1}=2^k-1.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}2^{r-1}=\\sum_{r=1}^k2^{r-1}+2^{k+1-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=2^k-1+2^k=2\\times2^k-1=2^{k+1}-1,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^n-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1 4^r=4^1=4,\\qquad \\frac43(4^1-1)=\\frac43\\times3=4,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^k4^r=\\frac43(4^k-1).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}4^r=\\sum_{r=1}^k4^r+4^{k+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac43(4^k-1)+4\\times4^k=\\frac43(4^k-1)+\\frac43\\times3\\times4^k\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac43(4^k-1+3\\times4^k)=\\frac43(4\\times4^k-1)=\\frac43(4^{k+1}-1),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac43(4^n-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.48-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n r=\\frac12n(n+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n r^2=\\frac16n(n+1)(2n+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n r^3=\\frac14n^2(n+1)^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1r=1=1,\\qquad \\frac12\\times1(1+1)=\\frac12\\times2=1,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k r=\\frac12k(k+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}r=\\sum_{r=1}^k r+(k+1)=\\frac12k(k+1)+(k+1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac12(k+1)[k+2]=\\frac12(k+1)(k+2),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac12n(n+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1r^2=1^2=1,\\qquad \\frac16\\times1(1+1)(2+1)=\\frac16\\times2\\times3=1,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k r^2=\\frac16k(k+1)(2k+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}r^2=\\sum_{r=1}^k r^2+(k+1)^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16k(k+1)(2k+1)+(k+1)^2=\\frac16(k+1)[k(2k+1)+6(k+1)]\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16(k+1)[2k^2+7k+6]=\\frac16(k+1)(k+2)(2k+3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16(k+1)(k+1+1)(2(k+1)+1),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac16n(n+1)(2n+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1r^3=1^3=1,\\qquad \\frac14\\times1^2(1+1)^2=\\frac14\\times4=1,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k r^3=\\frac14k^2(k+1)^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}r^3=\\sum_{r=1}^k r^3+(k+1)^3=\\frac14k^2(k+1)^2+(k+1)^3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac14(k+1)^2[k^2+4(k+1)]=\\frac14(k+1)^2[k^2+4k+4]\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16(k+1)^2(k+2)^2,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac14n^2(n+1)^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.48-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n r(r-1)=\\frac13n(n-1)(n+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1r(r-1)=1\\times0=0,\\qquad \\frac13\\times1(1-1)(1+1)=0,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k r(r-1)=\\frac13k(k-1)(k+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}r(r-1)=\\sum_{r=1}^k r(r-1)+(k+1)(k+1-1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac13k(k-1)(k+1)+k(k+1)=\\frac13k(k+1)[(k-1)+3]\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac13(k+1)k(k+2),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac13n(n-1)(n+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.48-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-3-4-3+\\cdots+n(n-4)=\\frac16n(n+1)(2n-11)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-3-4-3+\\cdots+n(n-4)=\\sum_{r=1}^n r(r-4).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1r(r-4)=1\\times-3=-3,\\qquad \\frac16\\times1\\times2\\times(2-11)=\\frac16\\times2\\times-9=-3,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k r(r-4)=\\frac16k(k+1)(2k-11)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}r(r-4)=\\sum_{r=1}^k r(r-4)+(k+1)(k+1-4)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16k(k+1)(2k-11)+(k+1)(k-3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16(k+1)[k(2k-11)+6(k-3)]\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16(k+1)(2k^2-5k-18)=\\frac13(k+1)(k+2)(2k-9)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16(k+1)(k+2)(2(k+1)-11),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac16n(n+1)(2n-11)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.48-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Michael is partway through a proof, he writes: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}r(r+3)=\\sum_{r=1}^k r(r+3)+(k+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Identify his mistake and correct this line of working.</p>","steps":["<p>He wrote <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> rather than the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(k+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>th term. So</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}r(r+3)=\\sum_{r=1}^k r(r+3)+(k+1)(k+4).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.48-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac1{(r+1)(r+2)}=\\frac n{2n+4}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1\\frac1{(r+1)(r+2)}=\\frac1{2\\times3}=\\frac16,\\qquad \\frac1{2+4}=\\frac16,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k\\frac1{(r+1)(r+2)}=\\frac{k}{2k+4}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}\\frac1{(r+1)(r+2)}=\\sum_{r=1}^k\\frac1{(r+1)(r+2)}+\\frac1{(k+1+1)(k+1+2)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{k}{2k+4}+\\frac1{(k+2)(k+3)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{k(k+3)}{2(k+2)(k+3)}+\\frac2{2(k+2)(k+3)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{k^2+3k+2}{2(k+2)(k+3)}=\\frac{(k+2)(k+1)}{2(k+2)(k+3)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{k+1}{2(k+3)}=\\frac{k+1}{2k+6}=\\frac{k+1}{2(k+1)+4},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac n{2n+4}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.48-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac1{(r+2)(r+4)}=\\frac{n(7n+25)}{24(n+3)(n+4)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1\\frac1{(r+2)(r+4)}=\\frac1{3\\times5}=\\frac1{15},\\quad \\frac{1(7+25)}{24\\times4\\times5}=\\frac{32}{480}=\\frac1{15},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k\\frac1{(r+2)(r+4)}=\\frac{k(7k+25)}{24(k+3)(k+4)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}\\frac1{(r+2)(r+4)}=\\sum_{r=1}^k\\frac1{(r+2)(r+4)}+\\frac1{(k+1+2)(k+1+4)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{k(7k+25)}{24(k+3)(k+4)}+\\frac1{(k+3)(k+5)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{k(7k+25)(k+5)}{24(k+3)(k+4)(k+5)}+\\frac{24(k+4)}{24(k+3)(k+4)(k+5)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{k(7k^2+60k+125)+24(k+4)}{24(k+3)(k+4)(k+5)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{7k^3+60k^2+149k+96}{24(k+3)(k+4)(k+5)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{(k+3)(7k^2+39k+32)}{24(k+3)(k+4)(k+5)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{7k^2+39k+32}{24(k+4)(k+5)}=\\frac{(k+1)(7k+32)}{24(k+4)(k+5)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{(k+1)(7(k+1)+25)}{24(k+4)(k+5)},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{n(7n+25)}{24(n+3)(n+4)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.48-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac1{3^r}=\\frac12-\\frac1{2\\times3^n}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac r{2^r}=2-\\frac{n+2}{2^n}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n(r+1)2^r=n\\times2^{n+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1\\frac1{3^r}=\\frac13,\\qquad \\frac12-\\frac1{2\\times3^1}=\\frac12-\\frac16=\\frac13,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k\\frac1{3^r}=\\frac12-\\frac1{2\\times3^k}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}\\frac1{3^r}=\\sum_{r=1}^k\\frac1{3^r}+\\frac1{3^{k+1}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac12-\\frac1{2\\times3^k}+\\frac1{3^{k+1}}=\\frac12-\\frac1{2\\times3\\times3^k}+\\frac1{3\\times3^k}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac12-\\frac1{6\\times3^k}=\\frac12-\\frac1{2\\times3^{k+1}},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac12-\\frac1{2\\times3^n}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1\\frac r{2^r}=\\frac1{2^1}=\\frac12,\\qquad 2-\\frac{1+2}{2^1}=2-\\frac32=\\frac12,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k\\frac r{2^r}=2-\\frac{k+2}{2^k}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}\\frac r{2^r}=\\sum_{r=1}^k\\frac r{2^r}+\\frac{k+1}{2^{k+1}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=2-\\frac{k+2}{2^k}+\\frac{k+1}{2^{k+1}}=2-\\frac{2(k+2)}{2\\times2^k}+\\frac{k+1}{2^{k+1}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=2+\\frac{-2(k+2)+k+1}{2^{k+1}}=2+\\frac{-2k-4+k+1}{2^{k+1}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=2-\\frac{k+3}{2^{k+1}},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2-\\frac{n+2}{2^n}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1(r+1)2^r=2\\times2^1=4,\\qquad 1\\times2^{1+1}=4,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k(r+1)2^r=k\\times2^{k+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}(r+1)2^r=\\sum_{r=1}^k(r+1)2^r+(k+1+1)2^{k+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=k\\times2^{k+1}+(k+1+1)2^{k+1}=2k\\times2^{k+1}+2\\times2^{k+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=2\\times2^{k+1}(k+1)=2^1\\times2^{k+1}(k+1)=(k+1)2^{k+2},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\times2^{n+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.48-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>It is conjectured that for constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle S_n=\\sum_{r=1}^n(r+1)^2=\\frac16n(an^2+bn+c)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>By considering <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"S_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"S_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"S_3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=9\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=13\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Prove the conjecture by induction.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Set <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^2=\\frac16(a+b+c)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Set <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^2+3^2=\\frac13(4a+2b+c)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Set <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^2+3^2+4^2=\\frac12(9a+3b+c)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Which gives:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"24=a+b+c\\quad(1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"39=4a+2b+c\\quad(2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"58=9a+3b+c\\quad(3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Solving simultaneously:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(2)-(1):\\quad15=3a+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(3)-(1):\\quad34=8a+2b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=9\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=24-2-9=13\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. So that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=9\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=13\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as req.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1(r+1)^2=2^2=4,\\qquad \\frac16\\times1(2+9+13)=\\frac16\\times24=4,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k(r+1)^2=\\frac16k(2k^2+9k+13)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}(r+1)^2=\\sum_{r=1}^k(r+1)^2+(k+2)^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16k(2k^2+9k+13)+(k+2)^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16[k(2k^2+9k+13)+6(k+2)^2]\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16[2k^3+15k^2+37k+24]=\\frac16(k+1)(2k^2+13k+24)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16(k+1)(2(k+1)^2-4k-2+13k+24)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16(k+1)(2(k+1)^2+9k+22)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16(k+1)(2(k+1)^2+9(k+1)+13),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac16n(2n^2+9n+13)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.48-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n(r+i)=-n+\\frac12n(n+1)i\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1(r+i)i=-1+i,\\qquad -1+\\frac12\\times1(1+1)i=-1+i,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k(r+i)i=-k+\\frac12k(k+1)i\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}(r+i)i=\\sum_{r=1}^k(r+i)i+(k+1+i)i\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=-k+\\frac12k(k+1)i+(k+1+i)i\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=-k+\\frac12k^2i+\\frac12ki+ki+i-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=-(k+1)+\\left(\\frac12k^2+\\frac32k+1\\right)i\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=-(k+1)+\\frac12(k^2+3k+2)i\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=-(k+1)+\\frac12(k+1)(k+2)i,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-n+\\frac12n(n+1)i\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.48-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n r\\times r!=(n+1)!-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1r\\times r!=1\\times1!=1,\\qquad (1+1)!-1=2-1=1,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k r\\times r!=(k+1)!-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}r\\times r!=\\sum_{r=1}^k r\\times r!+(k+1)\\times(k+1)!\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=(k+1)!-1+(k+1)\\times(k+1)!\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=[(k+1)!+(k+1)\\times(k+1)!]-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=(k+1)![(k+1)+1]-1=(k+1)!(k+2)-1=(k+2)!-1,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(n+1)!-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.48-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac r{(r+1)!}=1-\\frac1{(n+1)!}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1\\frac r{(r+1)!}=\\frac1{2!}=\\frac12,\\qquad 1-\\frac1{(1+1)!}=1-\\frac12=\\frac12,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k\\frac r{(r+1)!}=1-\\frac1{(k+1)!}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}\\frac r{(r+1)!}=\\sum_{r=1}^k\\frac r{(r+1)!}+\\frac{k+1}{(k+2)!}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=1-\\frac1{(k+1)!}+\\frac{k+1}{(k+2)!}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=1-\\frac{k+2}{(k+2)(k+1)!}+\\frac{k+1}{(k+2)!}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=1-\\frac{k+2}{(k+2)!}+\\frac{k+1}{(k+2)!}=1-\\frac1{(k+2)!},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1-\\frac1{(n+1)!}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.48-q14","number":14,"question":"<p>Prove, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\\in\\mathbb R\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac1{(r+a)(r+a+1)}=\\frac n{(1+a)(n+1+a)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1\\frac1{(r+a)(r+a+1)}=\\frac1{(1+a)(2+a)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac1{(1+a)(1+1+a)}=\\frac1{(1+a)(2+a)},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k\\frac1{(r+a)(r+a+1)}=\\frac{k}{(1+a)(k+1+a)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k}\\frac1{(r+a)(r+a+1)}=\\sum_{r=1}^k\\frac1{(r+a)(r+a+1)}+\\frac1{(k+1+a)(k+1+a+1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{k}{(1+a)(k+1+a)}+\\frac1{(k+1+a)(k+2+a)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{k(k+2+a)}{(1+a)(k+1+a)(k+2+a)}+\\frac{1+a}{(1+a)(k+1+a)(k+2+a)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{k^2+2k+ak+1+a}{(1+a)(k+1+a)(k+2+a)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{(k+1+a)(k+1)}{(1+a)(k+1+a)(k+2+a)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{k+1}{(1+a)(k+2+a)},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{n}{(1+a)(n+1+a)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.48-q15","number":15,"question":"<p>Prove, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\\in\\mathbb R\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n a^r=\\frac{a(a^n-1)}{a-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1a^r=a^1=a,\\qquad \\frac{a(a^1-1)}{a-1}=\\frac{a(a-1)}{a-1}=a,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^k a^r=\\frac{a(a^k-1)}{a-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}a^r=\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}a^r+(k+1)^r\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{a(a^k-1)}{a-1}+a^{k+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{a(a^k-1)}{a-1}+\\frac{(a-1)a^{k+1}}{a-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{a\\times a^k-a+a\\times a^{k+1}-a^{k+1}}{a-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{a^{k+1}-a+a\\times a^{k+1}-a^{k+1}}{a-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{-a+a\\times a^{k+1}}{a-1}=\\frac{a(a^{k+1}-1)}{a-1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{a(a^n-1)}{a-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]}]